  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Given below are two statements:</p><p>Statement <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math>: A mixture of chloroform and aniline can be separated by simple distillation.</p><p>Statement <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi></math>: When separating aniline from a mixture of aniline and water by steam distillation aniline boils below its boiling point.</p><p>In the light of the above statements, choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below:</p>"
  },
